{"id":"5d5e197234e9b36c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Accessible Category","display":"df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category — ZFC Logic9 Accessible Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category — ZFC Logic9 Accessible Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-directed-colimit-data.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-accessible-category — ZFC Logic9 Accessible Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50b20f786d960883\" href=\"?note=50b20f786d960883\" title=\"58-df-directed-colimit-data.md\">58-df-directed-colimit-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md\">../batch17/58-df-colimit.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>，范畴使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a> 的既有六元集合编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Mor}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob},\\operatorname{Mor}\\)</span> 及函子分量来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为存在量化的无限正则基数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 为对象的集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的六个辅助谓词全部采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"50b20f786d960883\" href=\"?note=50b20f786d960883\" title=\"58-df-directed-colimit-data.md\">58-df-directed-colimit-data.md</a> 中的公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AccessibleCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AccessibleCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 仍为一元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle D_0,D_1\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle D_0,D_1\\rangle\\)</span>，生成族条件约束对象映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(D_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(D_0)\\)</span>，不把函子代码本身作为单个函数取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ColimitObject}\">\\(\\mathrm{ColimitObject}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"50b20f786d960883\" href=\"?note=50b20f786d960883\" title=\"58-df-directed-colimit-data.md\">58-df-directed-colimit-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Colimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{Colimit}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md\">../batch17/58-df-colimit.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}accessible\\text{-}category}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AccessibleCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\mathcal C,\\kappa))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists J,D,L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D))\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,D,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(X,L,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}accessible\\text{-}category}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AccessibleCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\mathcal C,\\kappa))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists J,D,L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D))\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,D,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(X,L,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>生成族由可表现对象构成，并要求拥有相应定向余极限。不能以常值图式的存在代替这两个条件。</li>\n<li>同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,D\">\\(J,D\\)</span> 同时用于定向性、函子条件和五元余极限条件。三元兼容投影不再掩盖索引范畴的选择。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-directed-colimit-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"50b20f786d960883"